  "article_notes": "Case-control (incidence) and retrospective cohort (severity) study at OVAH (primary-care Outpatient Department plus 112 referrals). Only the cohort part (severity) is extracted; the case-control incidence comparisons (Tables 1-3) are infected vs non-infected dogs and are counted as skipped. Diagnosis by blood smear only; the authors assume B. rossi. The exposure was gonadectomy, mapped to Sex / neuter status. Effect modification by sex on severity: LRT P = 0.35 (the value is split from its sentence in the PDF conversion), not extracted as a row. Group sizes in the sex subset rows (149/155, 252/232) are as printed in Tables 5-6 and do not match the Table 4 sex totals (170/188, 300/265); likely missing-data exclusions or a print error. Tipping-point sensitivity analysis (Fig. 4) not extracted.",
